{"id":"1c09889422d33e53","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-forcing.md","title":"Forcing Method","display":"df-forcing — Forcing Method","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-forcing","aliases":["92-df-forcing"],"display":"df-forcing — Forcing Method","depends_on":["[[92-df-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-forcing — Forcing Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (countable transitive set with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models_{\\in}\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\">\\(M\\models_{\\in}\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\in M\">\\(\\mathbb P=(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\in M\\)</span> (forcing preorder)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span> (candidate generic filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in P\">\\(p\\in P\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\tau\\in(\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M)^r\">\\(\\vec\\tau\\in(\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M)^r\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1})\">\\(\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1})\\)</span> (arity, condition, names, and set-theory formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G\\)</span> (name-valuation map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic-filter predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\in}\">\\(\\models_{\\in}\\)</span> (satisfaction for the first-order language of set theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\">\\(\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\\)</span> (definition-target semantic forcing relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash{}&amp;\nM\\models_{\\in}\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92},\\qquad\nM[G]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau)\n\\mid\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\},\\\\\n&amp;p\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall G\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\land p\\in G\n\\Longrightarrow\nM[G]\\models_{\\in}\n\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\vec\\tau))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash{}&amp;\nM\\models_{\\in}\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92},\\qquad\nM[G]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau)\n\\mid\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\},\\\\\n&amp;p\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall G\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\land p\\in G\n\\Longrightarrow\nM[G]\\models_{\\in}\n\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\vec\\tau))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Forcing方法：构造扩展模型</li>\n<li>Cohen发明，解决独立性</li>\n<li>从可数传递模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic 滤子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 构造扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span></li>\n<li>上式定义的是外部语义 forcing；通常在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中按名字秩递归定义 forcing 关系，再由 Forcing Theorem 证明它与上式等价</li>\n<li>这里使用集合论语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\in}\">\\(\\models_{\\in}\\)</span>，不能复用算术签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> 的满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>强大的独立性证明工具</li>\n<li>证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>CH一致</li>\n<li>现代集论核心方法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M$ (countable transitive set with $M\\models_{\\in}\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}$, see [[92-df-zfc]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M\\models_{\\in}\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P=(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\tau\\in(\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M)^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash{}&\nM\\models_{\\in}\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92},\\qquad\nM[G]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\tau)\n\\mid\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\},\\\\\n&p\\Vdash^{\\mathbb P}_M\\varphi(\\vec\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall G\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MGen}^{\\mathbb P}_M(G)\\land p\\in G\n\\Longrightarrow\nM[G]\\models_{\\in}\n\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathbb P}_G(\\vec\\tau))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg","display":false}],"bytes":1862,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-s